{"id":1151102,"name":"依唯·审查Ⅱ","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"依唯·审查Ⅱ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1151102]}],"trial":{"trial_id":151102,"stage":"阶段2","unlock_time":"2026-10-08 14:00:00","diary1":"依唯知错，但仍希望能在妙丽喵第365场演出上完成自己准备多时的应援。出于医疗监护和调查需要，你同意以外勤身份随行。\n　　这场演出或许能让你看清，依唯所信任的偶像，究竟是利用和助长她的讨好型人格的恶劣压榨者，还是真的能照亮她的未来，帮助她走出困境的明亮星辰。","diary2":"在演出现场，粉丝们承担了大量本该由经纪公司负责的工作，依唯也强忍病痛，只为把准备好的惊喜送上舞台。\n　　可这份她视若珍宝的应援，却被妙丽喵当众拒绝。你和依唯赶到后台，更是偶然听见妙丽喵也亲口否定了她的付出，依唯大受打击，当场昏厥。看来，妙丽喵背叛了你的期待，她也只是另一个压榨粉丝的恶劣偶像……真的吗？","evidence":[{"ID":260981,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260982,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":3,"dialogue_id":251102004,"next":[5]},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251102022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id